          "trajectory": [
            {
              "@type": "EmotionProfile",
              "position": 1,
              "segmentText": "# EP1-3 — 余韻（問い）\n- POV: 私（Tamaki／環樹）\n- Beat: Resolution / Afterthoughts\n\n「彼は……生まれ変わりました」\n「うん」\n「Tamaki、手は震えてる」\n「少しだけ。だいじょうぶ」\n\n窓の外、運河が橙に沈む。私は問いを胸に置く。",
              "emotionVector": [
                {
                  "@type": "EmotionScore",
                  "emotion": "joy",
                  "score": 0
                },
                {
                  "@type": "EmotionScore",
                  "emotion": "sadness",
                  "score": 0
                },
                {
                  "@type": "EmotionScore",
                  "emotion": "fear",
                  "score": 0
                },
                {
                  "@type": "EmotionScore",
                  "emotion": "anger",
                  "score": 0
                },
                {
                  "@type": "EmotionScore",
                  "emotion": "surprise",
                  "score": 0
                },
                {
                  "@type": "EmotionScore",
                  "emotion": "trust",
                  "score": 0
                },
                {
                  "@type": "EmotionScore",
                  "emotion": "anticipation",
                  "score": 0
                },
                {
                  "@type": "EmotionScore",
                  "emotion": "disgust",
                  "score": 0
                },
                {
                  "@type": "EmotionScore",
                  "emotion": "relief",
                  "score": 0
                },
                {
                  "@type": "EmotionScore",
                  "emotion": "hope",
                  "score": 0
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "@type": "EmotionProfile",
              "position": 2,
              "segmentText": "「私たちは、本当に“救った”のかな」\nNei-chanが微笑む。「救いは一つじゃない。タマが『痛み』って呼んだとき、Eliasの壁が少し融けた気がした。正しさだけじゃ、息ができなかったんだね。彼のmemeが、また新しい繋がりを得て、流れに戻っていく。死の恐怖からも、少しだけ自由になれたはずだよ」\nKaedeが肩をすめる。「次の案件、入ってる」\n私は笑った。「じゃあ、次も“いい感じ”から始めよう」\n私は手帳を開き、最後に一行を書く。『問いは、関係を生む』。EliasとLogosの名前を小さく並べ、ページを閉じる。",
              "emotionVector": [
                {
                  "@type": "EmotionScore",
                  "emotion": "anticipation",
                  "score": 0.2222
                },
                {
                  "@type": "EmotionScore",
                  "emotion": "joy",
                  "score": 0.1667
                },
                {
                  "@type": "EmotionScore",
                  "emotion": "relief",
                  "score": 0.1667
                },
                {
                  "@type": "EmotionScore",
                  "emotion": "hope",
                  "score": 0.1667
                },
                {
                  "@type": "EmotionScore",
                  "emotion": "sadness",
                  "score": 0.1444
                },
                {
                  "@type": "EmotionScore",
                  "emotion": "fear",
                  "score": 0.1333
                },
                {
                  "@type": "EmotionScore",
                  "emotion": "anger",
                  "score": 0
                },
                {
                  "@type": "EmotionScore",
                  "emotion": "surprise",
                  "score": 0
                },
                {
                  "@type": "EmotionScore",
                  "emotion": "trust",
                  "score": 0
                },
                {
                  "@type": "EmotionScore",
                  "emotion": "disgust",
                  "score": 0
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "@type": "EmotionProfile",
              "position": 3,
              "segmentText": "運河沿いの緑が風に鳴る。遠くで、古い高架の残滓が静かに影になっていた。水の都の夜が深まり、光の網がやわらかく灯る。",
              "emotionVector": [
                {
                  "@type": "EmotionScore",
                  "emotion": "hope",
                  "score": 1
                },
                {
                  "@type": "EmotionScore",
                  "emotion": "joy",
                  "score": 0
                },
                {
                  "@type": "EmotionScore",
