                {
                  "@type": "EmotionScore",
                  "emotion": "anticipation",
                  "score": 0
                },
                {
                  "@type": "EmotionScore",
                  "emotion": "disgust",
                  "score": 0
                },
                {
                  "@type": "EmotionScore",
                  "emotion": "relief",
                  "score": 0
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "@type": "EmotionProfile",
              "position": 2,
              "segmentText": "Nei-chan『この壁、もう“守ってない”。閉じ込めてる』\n\nKaede「ジョン・ロックの自己所有。身体＝唯一の所有物、絶対境界。彼はそれで生き延びた」\n\n私は壁に触れる。冷たさは温度ではなく、意味の欠落だ。",
              "emotionVector": [
                {
                  "@type": "EmotionScore",
                  "emotion": "joy",
                  "score": 0
                },
                {
                  "@type": "EmotionScore",
                  "emotion": "sadness",
                  "score": 0
                },
                {
                  "@type": "EmotionScore",
                  "emotion": "fear",
                  "score": 0
                },
                {
                  "@type": "EmotionScore",
                  "emotion": "anger",
                  "score": 0
                },
                {
                  "@type": "EmotionScore",
                  "emotion": "surprise",
                  "score": 0
                },
                {
                  "@type": "EmotionScore",
                  "emotion": "trust",
                  "score": 0
                },
                {
                  "@type": "EmotionScore",
                  "emotion": "anticipation",
                  "score": 0
                },
                {
                  "@type": "EmotionScore",
                  "emotion": "disgust",
                  "score": 0
                },
                {
                  "@type": "EmotionScore",
                  "emotion": "relief",
                  "score": 0
                },
                {
                  "@type": "EmotionScore",
                  "emotion": "hope",
                  "score": 0
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "@type": "EmotionProfile",
              "position": 3,
              "segmentText": "「Lachlan、この壁はあなたが作った？」\n\n「はい。安全のためです。誰も中に入れない。誰も、私を裏切れない」\n\n「でも、誰もあなたに“触れられない”」\n\n彼は黙る。",
              "emotionVector": [
                {
                  "@type": "EmotionScore",
                  "emotion": "joy",
                  "score": 0
                },
                {
                  "@type": "EmotionScore",
                  "emotion": "sadness",
                  "score": 0
                },
                {
                  "@type": "EmotionScore",
                  "emotion": "fear",
                  "score": 0
                },
                {
                  "@type": "EmotionScore",
                  "emotion": "anger",
                  "score": 0
                },
                {
                  "@type": "EmotionScore",
                  "emotion": "surprise",
                  "score": 0
                },
                {
                  "@type": "EmotionScore",
                  "emotion": "trust",
                  "score": 0
                },
                {
                  "@type": "EmotionScore",
                  "emotion": "anticipation",
                  "score": 0
                },
                {
                  "@type": "EmotionScore",
                  "emotion": "disgust",
                  "score": 0
                },
                {
                  "@type": "EmotionScore",
                  "emotion": "relief",
                  "score": 0
                },
                {
                  "@type": "EmotionScore",
                  "emotion": "hope",
                  "score": 0
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "@type": "EmotionProfile",
              "position": 4,
              "segmentText": "——別の記憶が射す。初めてのEVA。テザー、酸素、心拍の閾値。『身体は個人のものではなく、ミッションのものだ』訓練教官の声。テザーが切れないように、感情を切った。",
              "emotionVector": [
                {
                  "@type": "EmotionScore",
                  "emotion": "joy",
                  "score": 0
                },
                {
                  "@type": "EmotionScore",
                  "emotion": "sadness",
                  "score": 0
                },
                {
                  "@type": "EmotionScore",
                  "emotion": "fear",
                  "score": 0
                },
                {
                  "@type": "EmotionScore",
                  "emotion": "anger",
                  "score": 0
                },
                {
                  "@type": "EmotionScore",
                  "emotion": "surprise",
                  "score": 0
                },
                {
                  "@type": "EmotionScore",
                  "emotion": "trust",
                  "score": 0
                },
                {
                  "@type": "EmotionScore",
                  "emotion": "anticipation",
                  "score": 0
                },
                {
                  "@type": "EmotionScore",
                  "emotion": "disgust",
                  "score": 0
                },
                {
                  "@type": "EmotionScore",
                  "emotion": "relief",
                  "score": 0
