          "trajectory": [
            {
              "@type": "EmotionProfile",
              "position": 1,
              "segmentText": "# Session: Leo Kazan & Millia Stuart - Part 1\n\n```json\n{\n  \"@context\": \"https://ghosthacker.example.com/\",\n  \"@type\": \"EpisodePart\",\n  \"partOf\": \"episode:s3e2\",\n  \"position\": 1,\n  \"antagonist\": [\n    { \"@id\": \"character:leo-kazan\" },\n    { \"@id\": \"character:millia-stuart\" }\n  ]\n}\n```\n\n---\n\nKaede「今朝は川霧。気圧が下がってる。呼吸は深めに」\nHibiki「帯域は安定。昼のピークカットは解除済み」\nNei-chan『タマ、今日はカップル。空気、ちょっと熱い』\n\n朝の光が渋谷の運河を照らす。Nei-ch",
              "emotionVector": [
