                },
                {
                  "@type": "EmotionScore",
                  "emotion": "disgust",
                  "score": 0
                },
                {
                  "@type": "EmotionScore",
                  "emotion": "relief",
                  "score": 0
                },
                {
                  "@type": "EmotionScore",
                  "emotion": "hope",
                  "score": 0
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "@type": "EmotionProfile",
              "position": 7,
              "segmentText": "「彼らの“秩序”ではね」私は返す。「でも、私たちの仕事は違う」\n\n窓の外で、風がひとつ角を曲がる。私たちは声を荒げないまま、うなずきを交換した。",
              "emotionVector": [
                {
                  "@type": "EmotionScore",
